  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_01",
      "hash64": "F21FF600C8F591D1",
      "text": "……那麼，等稍後到了練習鋼琴的時間，\\n我會再來的。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_02",
      "hash64": "F21FF300C8F58CB8",
      "text": "請幫我把這句話轉達給少爺。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_01",
      "hash64": "C28BA22AC279F395",
      "text": "我、我知道了！\\n木非！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_03",
      "hash64": "F21FF400C8F58E6B",
      "text": "……哦？[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_04",
      "hash64": "F21FF900C8F596EA",
      "text": "您也是少爺的同學嗎？[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "39F812E04BEE9F91",
      "text": "少爺？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "39F80FE04BEE9A78",
      "text": "我不知道",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_05",
      "hash64": "F21FFA00C8F5989D",
      "text": "這樣啊……[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_06",
      "hash64": "F21FF700C8F59384",
      "text": "或許您不知道，\\n其實這裡是奧爾迪加少爺率領的\\r\\n妖精幫班閣道三小隊基地。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_02",
      "hash64": "C28B9F2AC279EE7C",
      "text": "那、那個，不要隨便\\n把這種事情告訴別人……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_07",
      "hash64": "F21FF800C8F59537",
      "text": "真是失禮了。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_08",
      "hash64": "F21FED00C8F58286",
      "text": "這位訪客是誰呢？[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "C28BA02AC279F02F",
      "text": "大概是我們的敵人！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_09",
      "hash64": "F21FEE00C8F58439",
      "text": "原來如此。\\n也就是說，您是少爺的敵人……是吧？[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "39F810E04BEE9C2B",
      "text": "沒錯！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "39F815E04BEEA4AA",
      "text": "應該是吧……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_10",
      "hash64": "F2237B00C8F8A9A7",
      "text": "嗯，原來如此。\\n這樣的話……[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "C28B9D2AC279EB16",
      "text": "嗯……？[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_11",
      "hash64": "F2237A00C8F8A7F4",
      "text": "能請您與我一戰嗎？[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_12",
      "hash64": "F2237D00C8F8AD0D",
      "text": "您需要準備嗎？\\n需要的話，我會等您的。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_13",
      "hash64": "F2237C00C8F8AB5A",
      "text": "那麼，請接招。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_14",
      "hash64": "F2237700C8F8A2DB",
      "text": "……真是太精彩了。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_15",
      "hash64": "F2237600C8F8A128",
      "text": "我的主人奧爾迪加少爺\\n實力在我之上，\\r\\n還請您多加小心。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_16",
      "hash64": "F2237900C8F8A641",
      "text": "那麼，我先告辭了。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "C28B9E2AC279ECC9",
      "text": "今、今天星苦了……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_06",
      "hash64": "C28B9B2AC279E7B0",
      "text": "剛剛那位紳士，\\n他好像是學院的上一任校長？大概？\\r\\n現在負責教育老大？聽說是這樣。\\r\\n然後他有時候會來接老大？可能是這樣……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "C28B9C2AC279E963",
      "text": "……啊，\\n現在不是說這些的時候！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "C28BA92AC279FF7A",
      "text": "我確定[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是敵人，\\n所以我要去報告了～！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "C28BAA2AC27A012D",
      "text": "今天星苦了～！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
